{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9da12809-c5ac-8c56-9bf9-469f02bb3c7b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T11:47:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:43:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:43:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a pothole. The same pothole, actually. It's been patched three times and it keeps opening right back up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:43:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three times, okay. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at the intersection near my house. I'm at 356 Memorial Boulevard, on the Easton's Beach side. The hole is right where the side street meets the Boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:43:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 356 Memorial. And when was the last patch, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, a few weeks ago, maybe three. They throw down some cold patch, it looks fine for a week, and then the rain gets in and the whole thing pops out. Gravel all over the road. It's a waste of the asphalt, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cold patch doesn't hold great this time of year, especially with the freezing and thawing. Has anyone had any damage from it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My neighbor did. Across the street. He hit it coming home one night, and he said it rattled the whole front end. Had to get the wheel checked. So it's not just me complaining about a bump."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:44:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's good to know. That helps, because it tells the crew it's a real hazard. Is it in the travel lane or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane. Right in the wheel path. You can't miss it unless you swerve, and then you're in the other lane. I see it every day, because I've got a chair by the window where I like to sit and think, and that window looks straight at the intersection. So I watch the cars bounce."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, you've got a front-row seat, then. Let me get this entered. I'll note it's a repeat, three patches, a neighbor's vehicle damaged, and that it's at the intersection by 356 Memorial Boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:45:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. And I'd like it noted that I want a real repair this time. Not another shovel of patch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes. I can't promise what the crew decides on the fix, but a repeat location like this gets flagged for them to look at differently. Do you want a call back, or just the reference number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The reference number, please. I want something to point to when I call again. And if you need me, it's 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0151. Okay, your reference number is going to be on the screen in just a second. [pause] Here it is. It's PW, then 1223, then 07. Do you want to write that down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me find a pen. Okay. PW, 1223, 07. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. PW-1223-07."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And how long, roughly, before somebody actually looks at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "With the holiday this week, I'd say sometime in the next several days to a week or so. Could be sooner if the crew is out that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Okay. Fine. I'll be watching from my chair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sure you will. Thanks for calling it in, Mr. Kearney. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:47:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you too. Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
